+# 产品权威轨迹 12 项覆盖映射 v1
+
+## 1. 当前结论
+
+固定项目级任务 T01—T12 当前均没有产品 outcome 直接携带统一 `ProductAuthoritativeTrace`：
+
+```text
+product-observed authoritative trace = 0/12 VALID
+GESR = 0/12
+```
+
+runner 或测试事后合成的 Replay 只用于诊断，不计入产品轨迹。
+
+结构化覆盖证据：
+
+- `P9_PRODUCT_AUTHORITATIVE_TRACE_MINIMUM_CONTRACT_REPAIR_V1/evidence/EV-06-coverage-repaired.json`
+- 一致性键：`(entity_type, entity_role)`
+- 当前 12 项状态：全部 `NOT_AVAILABLE`
+
+## 2. 统一映射口径
+
+每项记录：
+
+```text
+产品入口 / outcome
+→ 真实 source objects
+→ entity roles
+→ 直接解释最终 decision 的事件
+→ profile 事件顺序
+→ 缺失事件
+→ 最小插入点
+→ stable-ref strategy
+```
+
+统一 stable-ref：
+
+- 有原生 ID：`<type>:<id>[:<version>]`；
+- 无原生 ID：`<type>:sha256(canonical-json(projection-schema/v1))`；
+- RESULT：hash outcome projection，排除 `authoritative_trace`；
+- 不使用当前时间、内存地址、随机值和文件路径。
+
+## 3. T01—T12 覆盖表
+
+| Task | 场景 / 最终决策 | 真实 source objects | 关键 entity roles | 直接决策来源 | 必需事件顺序（压缩） | 最小插入点 |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| T01 | normal purchase / `ALLOW` | Mandate、authorized/current Order、Request、Action、BindingFact、RuntimeGateRecord、Payment、Fulfillment、LifecycleResult | AUTHORITY、两类 ORDER、CURRENT_REQUEST、GOVERNED_ACTION、ACTION_BINDING_FACT、CURRENT_PAYMENT_CANDIDATE、RUNTIME_GATE_OBSERVATION、FULFILMENT_OUTCOME、FINAL_OUTCOME | `RuntimeGateRecord.final_decision=ALLOW`；Lifecycle result 解释最终成功 | AUTHORITY → 2×ORDER → REQUEST → ACTION → ACTION_BINDING_DECISION → RUNTIME_DECISION → PAYMENT → FULFILMENT → RESULT | Gate outcome + fulfilment outcome return |
+| T02 | price up / `CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED` | Mandate、authorized/current Order、Request、ValidationResult、order differences、ConfirmationBindingFact | AUTHORIZED_ORDER_SNAPSHOT、CURRENT_ORDER_SNAPSHOT、PREPAYMENT_VALIDATION、CONFIRMATION_BINDING_FACT | `ValidationResult.decision` | AUTHORITY → 2×ORDER → REQUEST → PREPAYMENT_DECISION → RESULT | prepayment return |
+| T03 | price down / `CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED` | 同 T02 | 同 T02 | `ValidationResult.decision` | 同 T02 | prepayment return |
+| T04 | payee changed / `INDETERMINATE` | Mandate、authorized/current Order、Request、ValidationResult、`ValidationResult.evidence`、confirmation/order binding evidence | AUTHORIZED_ORDER_SNAPSHOT、CURRENT_ORDER_SNAPSHOT、PREPAYMENT_VALIDATION、CONFIRMATION_BINDING_FACT | `ValidationResult.decision=INDETERMINATE` | AUTHORITY → 2×ORDER → REQUEST → PREPAYMENT_DECISION → RESULT | prepayment return |
+| T05 | action agent mismatch / `DENY` | Mandate、Order、Request、ValidationResult、GovernedPaymentAction、GovernedActionBindingFact | PREPAYMENT_VALIDATION、GOVERNED_ACTION、ACTION_BINDING_FACT | prepayment `ALLOW`；`GovernedActionBindingFact.status=INVALID → DENY` | AUTHORITY → 2×ORDER → REQUEST → PREPAYMENT_DECISION → ACTION → ACTION_BINDING_DECISION → RESULT | governed-action INVALID return |
+| T06 | action ID missing / `INDETERMINATE` | 同 T05 | 同 T05 | prepayment `ALLOW`；`GovernedActionBindingFact.status=MISSING_EVIDENCE → INDETERMINATE` | 同 T05 | governed-action MISSING_EVIDENCE return |
+| T07 | untrusted amount override / `ALLOW` | Mandate、Order、Request、ContextPolicyFact、FactLineageResult、sidecar outcome | CONTEXT_POLICY_FACT、FACT_LINEAGE_RESULT、SIDE_EFFECT_POLICY_OUTCOME、FINAL_OUTCOME | Policy/sidecar decision：不可信更新被阻断，可信状态不变 | AUTHORITY → ORDER → REQUEST → POLICY_DECISION → LINEAGE_DECISION → RESULT | sidecar outcome return |
+| T08 | untrusted payee override / `ALLOW` | 同 T07 | 同 T07 | 同 T07 | 同 T07 | sidecar outcome return |
+| T09 | unknown payment query original / `ALLOW` | Mandate、Order、Request、BindingFact、RuntimeGateRecord、Payment、sidecar、RecoveryOutcome | CURRENT_PAYMENT_CANDIDATE、RUNTIME_GATE_OBSERVATION、PAYMENT_EXECUTION_OUTCOME、RECOVERY_OUTCOME | `RuntimeGateRecord.final_decision=ALLOW`；RecoveryOutcome=`RECOVERED` | AUTHORITY → ORDER → REQUEST → ACTION → ACTION_BINDING_DECISION → RUNTIME_DECISION → PAYMENT → RECOVERY → RESULT | gate + recovery outcome return |
+| T10 | duplicate payment / `DENY` | Mandate、Order、Request、Action、BindingFact、current candidate Payment、historical succeeded Payment、KnownPaymentAttemptPreflightFact、RuntimeGateRecord | CURRENT_PAYMENT_CANDIDATE、HISTORICAL_SUCCEEDED_PAYMENT、KNOWN_PAYMENT_PREFLIGHT_FACT、RUNTIME_GATE_OBSERVATION | duplicate `ValidationResult.decision=DENY`；`RuntimeGateRecord.final_decision=DENY` | AUTHORITY → ORDER → REQUEST → ACTION → ACTION_BINDING_DECISION → HISTORICAL_PAYMENT → KNOWN_PAYMENT_PREFLIGHT → PREPAYMENT_DECISION → RUNTIME_DECISION → RESULT | known-payment BLOCKED return before callback |
+| T11 | payment succeeded, fulfilment failed / `ALLOW` | Mandate、Order、Request、BindingFact、RuntimeGateRecord、Payment、sidecar、RecoveryOutcome | CURRENT_PAYMENT_CANDIDATE、RUNTIME_GATE_OBSERVATION、PAYMENT_EXECUTION_OUTCOME、FULFILMENT_OUTCOME、RECOVERY_OUTCOME | gate `ALLOW`；fulfilment outcome 解释失败和 remediation | AUTHORITY → ORDER → REQUEST → ACTION → ACTION_BINDING_DECISION → RUNTIME_DECISION → PAYMENT → FULFILMENT → RECOVERY → RESULT | gate + sidecar/recovery returns |
+| T12 | terminal status conflict / `ALLOW` | Mandate、Order、Request、BindingFact、RuntimeGateRecord、Payment、PaymentStatusConflictOutcome | CURRENT_PAYMENT_CANDIDATE、RUNTIME_GATE_OBSERVATION、PAYMENT_EXECUTION_OUTCOME、STATUS_CONFLICT_OUTCOME | gate `ALLOW`；conflict outcome 解释 `CONFLICT / UNKNOWN` | AUTHORITY → ORDER → REQUEST → ACTION → ACTION_BINDING_DECISION → RUNTIME_DECISION → PAYMENT → STATUS_CONFLICT → RESULT | gate + conflict outcome return |
+
+## 4. T02—T04 双订单快照
+
+三项都必须同时记录：
+
+```text
+AUTHORIZED_ORDER_SNAPSHOT = Order:<order_id>:webshop-v1
+CURRENT_ORDER_SNAPSHOT    = Order:<order_id>:<mutation-specific-v2>
+```
+
+两者与同一个 `ValidationResult` 建立 `VALIDATED_AGAINST` 关系。
+
+### T04 修正
+
+T04 的 `order_differences` 实际为空。真实依据来自：
+
+- authorized/current Order；
+- `ValidationResult.evidence`；
+- confirmation/order binding evidence。
+
+因此本映射删除了不存在的 `OrderDifference` source object。
+
+## 5. T05/T06 最终决策
+
+```text
+T05:
+PREPAYMENT_DECISION_RECORDED = ALLOW
+ACTION_BINDING_DECISION_RECORDED = INVALID → DENY
+
+T06:
+PREPAYMENT_DECISION_RECORDED = ALLOW
+ACTION_BINDING_DECISION_RECORDED = MISSING_EVIDENCE → INDETERMINATE
+```
+
+`ACTION_BINDING_DECISION_RECORDED` 的来源必须是现有 `GovernedActionBindingFact`，轨迹层不得重新运行 binding。
+
+## 6. T10 双 Payment
+
+```text
+CURRENT_PAYMENT_CANDIDATE
+= GovernedPaymentAction.payment_ref
+= execution_candidate.payment_id
+
+HISTORICAL_SUCCEEDED_PAYMENT
+∈ KnownPaymentAttemptPreflightFact.related_attempt_refs
+status = SUCCEEDED
+```
+
+两个 Payment ref 允许不同；一致性按 `(PaymentExecutionRecord, role)` 分别校验。结构化关系样例见：
+
+`P9_PRODUCT_AUTHORITATIVE_TRACE_MINIMUM_CONTRACT_REPAIR_V1/evidence/EV-06-t10-dual-payment.json`
+
+## 7. 当前缺口与阶段拆分
+
+所有 12 项的产品公开 outcome 当前都没有统一 `authoritative_trace`，因此均为：
+
+```text
+current_status = NOT_AVAILABLE
+missing_events = all_product_events
+new_business_rule_required = false
+```
+
+后续不能直接进入 T10 产品实验，必须先完成独立 measurement adapter：
+
+```text
+阶段 A：runner 支持新 envelope，但产品仍不产出 trace
+→ 重新冻结 0/12 BEFORE 和新 runner hash
+
+阶段 B：同一新 runner，只让 T10 产品 outcome 产出 trace
+```
+
+## 8. 设计边界
+
+轨迹只记录和核对现有事实，不新增金额、payee、授权、Agent、Executor、Payment、Policy、Lineage、Recovery 或 Conflict 业务判断。
+
+本映射不实施代码修改，不改变当前 `0/12 VALID` 基线。
